 [00:20:30\u8211\'9600:21:07]\line Oh yeah. So anyways, I'm trying to get him out of there. I'm like 5'9, but I don't\u8212\'97 I'm not near as big as Matthew. I can't physically get him out of there. So anyways, we're trying to get him out of there. He's ransacking through the entire basement just looking for DVDs and video games. I can't get over there. Then about 5 minutes later, police show up and there's probably about 2 or 3 of them. They're talking to me, seeing what methods we can use. to get him out of the basement. And I'm going to tell you, the police in my neighborhood are absolutely great. They were so understanding.}
