 [00:21:08\u8211\'9600:21:44]\line Yes, they were great and they were really empathetic towards him. And so we did\u8212\'97 one of the police officers said, hey, I got a Toy Story DVD up here for you. So he runs right up the basement stairs. And so he tries ransacking through another area of the house. And so it took me like 2 or 3 police officers to get down there. We get him out of the house. He's laying down on the front yard and we were able to gently restrain him. And so he's not melting down or anything. What it is that he's doing is he's staring at the officers' tattoos and totally fascinated by them.}
