Stephen Laine}{
 [00:21:45\u8211\'9600:22:15]\line Yeah. So we just gently holding him until the EMTs show up. EMTs show up. They take him to the hospital. I'm in the ambulance with them. He goes in the hospital. We're waiting at the ER and I talked to a psychiatrist after waiting for about an hour and a half. They give him some meds, stabilize him. He returns home. Okay. So he's good for a week at this point. You know, he returns home, he's fine. No issues.}
\par \pard\plain \s0\nowidctlpar\hyphpar0\ltrpar\kerning1\cf0\rtlch\af6\afs24\alang1081\ltrch\hich\af3\afs24\alang1033\dbch\af8\langfe2052\loch\f3\fs24\lang1033\ql\ltrpar{\b
