David Kaufer}{
 [00:41:02\u8211\'9600:41:10]\line And it really struck me just how traumatized he was and just how he just kind of needed that, you know, the comfort. I think, you know, a lot of this, they're looking for comfort.}
\par \pard\plain \s0\nowidctlpar\hyphpar0\ltrpar\kerning1\cf0\rtlch\af6\afs24\alang1081\ltrch\hich\af3\afs24\alang1033\dbch\af8\langfe2052\loch\f3\fs24\lang1033\ql\ltrpar{\b
