 [00:42:35\u8211\'9600:42:48]\line Yeah. And so he did well, he was quiet, wasn't disturbing anybody. And for those of you who haven't seen the new Spider-Man movie, I'm not gonna give any spoilers, but it's a long movie. It's about a 2.5-hour movie.}
