 [00:43:53\u8211\'9600:44:18]\line One of the things again that struck me, Steve, is you're carrying a lot. You know, like this, this again falls, falls on you. Um, how are you taking care of yourself? What are you doing? Because, you know, you, it's the, it's the analogy, it's a clich\u233\'e9. Yeah, it's true, right? Like the whole airplane's going down, you got to put on the oxygen mask for yourself before you can take care of your kids.}
\par \pard\plain \s0\nowidctlpar\hyphpar0\ltrpar\kerning1\cf0\rtlch\af6\afs24\alang1081\ltrch\hich\af3\afs24\alang1033\dbch\af8\langfe2052\loch\f3\fs24\lang1033\ql\ltrpar{\b
Stephen Laine}{
 [00:44:18\u8211\'9600:44:53]\line Well, I got a couple things I do. One thing is I would like to get back into is running. I've ran since I was 9. I love to run. I've ran since I was 9 years old. I ran competitively in middle school and high school, and then I stopped, and then I went back into it. about 6 years ago. This summer, I have not been able to run because of all the things that's been going on with Matthew. That's one thing I would like to get back into once things, if they do settle down, I will be getting back into running again. The other thing that I do is\u8212\'97}
\par \pard\plain \s0\nowidctlpar\hyphpar0\ltrpar\kerning1\cf0\rtlch\af6\afs24\alang1081\ltrch\hich\af3\afs24\alang1033\dbch\af8\langfe2052\loch\f3\fs24\lang1033\ql\ltrpar{\b
David Kaufer}{
 [00:44:53\u8211\'9600:45:15]\line That's huge. I want to applaud that because I think that's huge. I think the physical, again, speaking from experience, I've been a runner For much of my life. I haven't been running as much in the last year or two because of injuries and other things. But that's so healthy and just so cleansing, right? Like, it's just such a mind cleanse when you get out there.}
\par \pard\plain \s0\nowidctlpar\hyphpar0\ltrpar\kerning1\cf0\rtlch\af6\afs24\alang1081\ltrch\hich\af3\afs24\alang1033\dbch\af8\langfe2052\loch\f3\fs24\lang1033\ql\ltrpar{\b
Stephen Laine}{
 [00:45:15\u8211\'9600:45:46]\line Yep. And so that's one thing I might want to get back into maybe once I know things are more settled. That's my goal. Yeah. The one thing that I'm doing now is, like I said, my best friend, he lives right around the block from me. So I go over there whenever He's open and I'm open. You know, I see him sometimes on Saturday evenings. You know, that helps a lot when the boys are in bed. The other thing is that I do take care of myself, which you are probably aware of, is my writing. That's very therapeutic for me.}
