 [00:48:22\u8211\'9600:48:36]\line Happy. Resilience is everything, Steve. And you know, yeah, I think we, we all kind of can relate to that. Learning that we're stronger than we, than we thought. Yeah.\line Happy, good.\line Happy, good. All right, he's gonna, he's gonna disappear again. All right, well, we, we mentioned before that we like to have some fun, you know, kind of some fun segments that we want to include. And, you know, I'm gonna, I'm gonna launch into these. Each one of these, Steve, we have, uh, we have jingles to kind of play. And so we're gonna start with Autism Tip of the Week.}
\par \pard\plain \s0\nowidctlpar\hyphpar0\ltrpar\kerning1\cf0\rtlch\af6\afs24\alang1081\ltrch\hich\af3\afs24\alang1033\dbch\af8\langfe2052\loch\f3\fs24\lang1033\ql\ltrpar{\b
