David Kaufer}{
 [00:50:58\u8211\'9600:51:26]\line We're breaking down what's real, what's rumor, and what might surprise you. Let's go. All right, so this is again where we like to maybe kind of throw out a stereotype in a way. Maybe we already, uh, maybe we already did that with the Rain Man analogy, but you know, or talk about maybe something, uh, you know, something that people may not know, an autism fact that maybe people may not know. But again, if you have something, otherwise that's fine if you don't.}
