 [00:54:33\u8211\'9600:54:51]\line I mean, look, 2 opposites, right? Like going from full-blown denial to full-blown advocate. And before I forget, I want people\u8212\'97 how can people find you in terms of find your writing? Is it\u8212\'97 do you do anything beyond your Facebook posts?}
