 [00:57:30\u8211\'9600:58:02]\line Oh, that's great. And that's the perfect note to end things on. So, you know, Steve, I really do want to thank you across the board. Like I said, one of the things I really admire most is that, you know, you don't try to present a perfect picture of autism or parenting. You know, you simply share what's real, and I think that's why so many families are connecting to your writing. Your honesty helps make\u8212\'97 helps people feel less alone. So thank you again for joining us today and everything you're doing for our community.}
